-- S11: Kleene+ Exhaustive — A -> B+ -> C
-- EventFlux: CANNOT EXPRESS
-- Per ROADMAP.md: "A+, A* unbounded quantifiers (rejected by design)"
--
-- This file documents the capability gap. EventFlux only supports
-- bounded quantifiers like B{3} or B{2,5}, not unbounded B+ or B*.
--
-- Varpulis uses ZDD (Zero-suppressed Decision Diagrams) to enumerate
-- ALL possible Kleene combinations in polynomial memory, while naive
-- approaches require 2^n memory for n matching events.
--
-- CANNOT RUN IN EVENTFLUX
